{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f6ddbf68-d4ae-8513-8dec-f62fc3ba8e47",
  "created_at": "2026-01-06T10:10:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gina Pellegrino",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:03:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:03:09-05:00",
      "duration": 32,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Greg, good morning. Um, so I think I pressed the wrong number in your menu. I wanted the clerk's office and I think I hit, like, two, which got me you. So, my bad, I'm a professional at phones, clearly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:03:41-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happens all the time. The menu's a little tricky. What do you need? I might be able to help or I can send you over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:04:01-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, great. So I have a petition. Signatures and everything, a whole folder of them. I need to drop it off at City Hall and I just want to know what time the office closes today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:04:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Which office are you dropping it to? The city clerk usually takes petitions."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:04:40-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's the one I was trying to get. The city clerk. I thought that was option two, but I guess option two was you guys, and the clerk was three?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:05:04-05:00",
      "duration": 33,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, I think it's three. Or it might be four, honestly, they've shuffled it around. Either way, City Hall's general hours are the same for everybody in the building. We're open to the public until four-thirty on weekdays, and opening is eight-thirty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:05:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-thirty. Okay. And that's today, Tuesday, same as always?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:05:45-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same as always. Nothing special today that I know of. If you come in the main entrance, the clerk's office is on the first floor. Someone at the front can point you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:06:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Do I need an appointment or can I just walk in and hand it over?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:06:23-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Walk in is normally fine. I'd grab a receipt or ask them to stamp a copy so you've got proof of the date you dropped it off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:06:44-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's smart. I would not have thought of that. I'll make a copy of the first page. I'm a homeowner, not a paperwork wizard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:07:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Copy the whole thing if you can. Takes a minute and it saves headaches."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:07:16-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, will do. Is there parking near the building or should I expect to circle for twenty minutes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:07:31-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's downtown, so there's street parking and some lots nearby, but it can fill up. Give yourself a few extra minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:07:48-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. [pause] Sorry, I'm on speaker, can you hear me okay? I'm walking around the kitchen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:08:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Little echo, but I'm hearing you fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:08:08-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So just to repeat it back: City Hall, first floor, city clerk, open until four-thirty today, and get a stamped copy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:08:26-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. And if the clerk's office tells you the petition needs a particular format, they'll let you know at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:08:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Should I call them first to check that? Can you transfer me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:08:55-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can try. If it rings out, you'll land in their voicemail. Hang on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:09:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:09:11-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, it's ringing over there. [pause] Yeah, voicemail. Want me to still send you through, or you just head over?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:09:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nah, I'll just head over. I've got the hours, that's all I really needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:09:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Get there before four and you'll be fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:09:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks for putting up with my wrong button."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:09:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Have a good one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:09:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
